  "title": "Italian Grilled Cheese Sandwiches",
  "description": "I came up with this mozzarella grilled cheese recipe for my niece. I combined grilled cheese sandwiches with garlic bread. It's tasty, quick, and the perfect appetizer for friends, family, and unexpected guests.",
  "authors": [
